# Techlysis — environment template.
#
# This is a reference only. The static app does NOT read a .env file.
# Keys are resolved at runtime from (in priority order):
#   1. window.__TECHLYSIS_ENV   (set by js/env.runtime.js)
#   2. localStorage overrides   (in-app Settings → Keys panel)
#
# For local testing, either copy js/env.runtime.example.js → js/env.runtime.js
# or paste keys in the Settings → Keys panel (stored in your browser only).
#
# On GitHub Pages, .github/workflows/pages.yml injects the matching
# GitHub Secrets into js/env.runtime.js during deploy.

